    "How you wake after each sport": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wie du nach jeder Sportart aufwachst"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How you wake after each sport"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cómo amaneces tras cada deporte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's an association, not a cause. Things like training on the days you already wake up well (then drifting back down), resting when you're tired or sick, or which day of the week you train all play a part.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es ist ein Zusammenhang, keine Ursache. Dinge wie Training an den Tagen, an denen du ohnehin gut aufwachst (und danach natürlich wieder absinkst), Ruhe, wenn du müde oder krank bist, oder der Wochentag, an dem du trainierst, spielen alle eine Rolle."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's an association, not a cause. Things like training on the days you already wake up well (then drifting back down), resting when you're tired or sick, or which day of the week you train all play a part."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es una asociación, no una causa. Influyen cosas como entrenar justo los días que amaneces bien (y luego «bajar» de forma natural), descansar cuando estás cansado o enfermo, o el día de la semana en que sueles entrenar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's an estimate from your own history, not a diagnosis.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es ist eine Schätzung aus deinem eigenen Verlauf, keine Diagnose."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's an estimate from your own history, not a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es una estimación a partir de tu propio historial, no un diagnóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Medians over your own history (Plews et al., 2013; HRV via RMSSD, Task Force 1996).": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mediane über deinen eigenen Verlauf (Plews et al., 2013; HRV via RMSSD, Task Force 1996)."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Medians over your own history (Plews et al., 2013; HRV via RMSSD, Task Force 1996)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Medianas sobre tu historial (Plews et al., 2013; HRV vía RMSSD, Task Force 1996)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sessions like this are barely linked to any change in your next-day Charge (n=%lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einheiten wie diese hängen kaum mit einer Veränderung deines Charge am nächsten Tag zusammen (n=%lld)."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sessions like this are barely linked to any change in your next-day Charge (n=%lld)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las sesiones de este deporte apenas se relacionan con un cambio en tu Charge del día siguiente (n=%lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sessions like this are typically followed by a Charge about %lld points higher the next morning (n=%lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach so einer Einheit wachst du am nächsten Morgen meist mit einem Charge auf, der etwa %lld Punkte höher liegt (n=%lld)."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sessions like this are typically followed by a Charge about %lld points higher the next morning (n=%lld)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Después de una sesión así, sueles amanecer con un Charge unos %lld puntos más arriba (n=%lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sessions like this are typically followed by a Charge about %lld points higher the next morning, climbing back in about %lld days (n=%lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach so einer Einheit wachst du am nächsten Morgen meist mit einem Charge auf, der etwa %lld Punkte höher liegt, und nach etwa %lld Tagen erreichst du dein Niveau wieder (n=%lld)."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sessions like this are typically followed by a Charge about %lld points higher the next morning, climbing back in about %lld days (n=%lld)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Después de una sesión así, sueles amanecer con un Charge unos %lld puntos más arriba, y vuelves a tu nivel en unos %lld días (n=%lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sessions like this are typically followed by a Charge about %lld points higher the next morning, climbing back in about 1 day (n=%lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach so einer Einheit wachst du am nächsten Morgen meist mit einem Charge auf, der etwa %lld Punkte höher liegt, und nach etwa einem Tag erreichst du dein Niveau wieder (n=%lld)."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sessions like this are typically followed by a Charge about %lld points higher the next morning, climbing back in about 1 day (n=%lld)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Después de una sesión así, sueles amanecer con un Charge unos %lld puntos más arriba, y vuelves a tu nivel en un día (n=%lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sessions like this are typically followed by a Charge about %lld points lower the next morning (n=%lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach so einer Einheit wachst du am nächsten Morgen meist mit einem Charge auf, der etwa %lld Punkte niedriger liegt (n=%lld)."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
