            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Después de una sesión así, sueles amanecer con un Charge unos %lld puntos más abajo (n=%lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sessions like this are typically followed by a Charge about %lld points lower the next morning, climbing back in about %lld days (n=%lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
