    "Solid": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belastbar"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solid"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sólido"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is how your Charge tends to look the morning after each sport, compared with your rest days. It's what we observe in your history, not a cause-and-effect link.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "So sieht dein Charge typischerweise am Morgen nach jeder Sportart aus, verglichen mit deinen Ruhetagen. Es ist das, was wir in deinem Verlauf beobachten, kein Ursache-Wirkungs-Zusammenhang."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is how your Charge tends to look the morning after each sport, compared with your rest days. It's what we observe in your history, not a cause-and-effect link."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Así suele verse tu Charge la mañana después de cada deporte, comparado con tus días de descanso. Es lo que observamos en tu historial, no una relación de causa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We compare the median of your Charge the morning after each sport against your “untouched” rest days (no workouts, and not the days right after a session). The difference is what you see here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir vergleichen den Median deines Charge am Morgen nach jeder Sportart mit deinen „unberührten“ Ruhetagen (ohne Training und nicht die Tage direkt nach einer Einheit). Der Unterschied ist das, was du hier siehst."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We compare the median of your Charge the morning after each sport against your “untouched” rest days (no workouts, and not the days right after a session). The difference is what you see here."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comparamos la mediana de tu Charge la mañana siguiente a cada deporte contra tus días de descanso «intactos» (sin entrenamientos y fuera de los días posteriores a una sesión). La diferencia es lo que ves aquí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We need about 6 sessions of the same sport to start showing how you wake afterward. Keep logging your workouts and this fills in on its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wir brauchen etwa 6 Einheiten derselben Sportart, um zu zeigen, wie du danach aufwachst. Trage deine Workouts weiter ein, dann füllt sich das von selbst."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We need about 6 sessions of the same sport to start showing how you wake afterward. Keep logging your workouts and this fills in on its own."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Necesitamos unas 6 sesiones de un mismo deporte para empezar a ver cómo amaneces después. Sigue registrando tus entrenamientos y esto se llena solo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your workouts can come from Apple Health. Connect it from Today to add them here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Workouts können aus Apple Health kommen. Verbinde es über „Heute“, um sie hier hinzuzufügen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your workouts can come from Apple Health. Connect it from Today to add them here."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus entrenamientos pueden venir de Apple Health. Conéctalo desde Hoy para sumarlos aquí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
