    "How many breaths you take per minute while you sleep. It's one of the steadiest signals your body has, so even a small rise from your own normal can be an early sign of strain, illness, or a late, heavy meal.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How many breaths you take per minute while you sleep. It's one of the steadiest signals your body has, so even a small rise from your own normal can be an early sign of strain, illness, or a late, heavy meal."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuántas respiraciones tomas por minuto mientras duermes. Es una de las señales más estables de tu cuerpo, así que incluso una subida pequeña respecto a tu normal puede ser un aviso temprano de carga, de que algo viene, o de una cena pesada y tardía."
          }
        }
      }
    },
