    "I have read and accept these terms, and I'm using Cénit with my own device and my own data, at my own risk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "He leído y acepto estos términos, y uso Cénit con mi propio dispositivo y mis propios datos, bajo mi propio riesgo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I have read and accept these terms, and I'm using NOOP with my own device and my own data, at my own risk.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I have read and accept these terms, and I'm using NOOP with my own device and my own data, at my own risk."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "He leído y acepto estos términos, y uso NOOP con mi propio dispositivo y mis propios datos, bajo mi propio riesgo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I keep this project anonymous, so crypto is the only way to chip in — no Patreon, no PayPal, no name attached. Quick, global, and private for both of us.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich halte dieses Projekt anonym, daher ist Krypto die einzige Möglichkeit, beizutragen — kein Patreon, kein PayPal, kein Name. Schnell, weltweit und privat für uns beide."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I keep this project anonymous, so crypto is the only way to chip in — no Patreon, no PayPal, no name attached. Quick, global, and private for both of us."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mantengo este proyecto anónimo, así que las cripto son la única forma de cooperar — sin Patreon, sin PayPal, sin nombres. Rápido, global y privado para ambos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
