    "Log behaviours above — after a few days of answers, Cénit ranks how each one moves your recovery, HRV and sleep. Importing a WHOOP export (which includes its journal) backfills history instantly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Registra comportamientos arriba — tras unos días de respuestas, Cénit clasifica cómo cada uno mueve tu recuperación, HRV y sueño. Importar una exportación de WHOOP (que incluye su diario) rellena el historial al instante."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Log behaviours above — after a few days of answers, NOOP ranks how each one moves your recovery, HRV and sleep. Importing a WHOOP export (which includes its journal) backfills history instantly.": {
