    },
    "On WHOOP 5/MG this is experimental — arming is confirmed, but a strap-driven wake-up hasn't been verified yet, so don't rely on it as your only alarm there. WHOOP 4 is the proven path.": {
      "comment": "A description of the smart alarm feature.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En WHOOP 5/MG esto es experimental — el armado está confirmado, pero aún no se ha verificado un despertar accionado por la banda, así que no dependas de ella como tu única alarma ahí. WHOOP 4 es la vía probada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a 5/MG connection Cénit will send a puffin realtime-stream request after the handshake, and log what comes back. If you have a 5/MG strap, turning this on and sharing your strap log helps map the protocol. No effect on WHOOP 4.0.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bei einer 5/MG-Verbindung sendet Cénit nach dem Handshake eine Puffin-Echtzeitstream-Anfrage und protokolliert die Antwort. Wenn du einen 5/MG-Strap hast, hilft das Aktivieren und Teilen deines Strap-Protokolls, das Protokoll zu kartieren. Keine Auswirkung auf WHOOP 4.0."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On a 5/MG connection Cénit will send a puffin realtime-stream request after the handshake, and log what comes back. If you have a 5/MG strap, turning this on and sharing your strap log helps map the protocol. No effect on WHOOP 4.0."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En una conexión 5/MG, Cénit enviará una solicitud de transmisión en tiempo real (puffin) después del handshake y registrará lo que regrese. Si tienes una banda 5/MG, activarlo y compartir tu registro de banda ayuda a mapear el protocolo. No afecta a WHOOP 4.0."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a 5/MG connection NOOP will send a puffin realtime-stream request after the handshake, and log what comes back. If you have a 5/MG strap, turning this on and sharing your strap log helps map the protocol. No effect on WHOOP 4.0.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On a 5/MG connection NOOP will send a puffin realtime-stream request after the handshake, and log what comes back. If you have a 5/MG strap, turning this on and sharing your strap log helps map the protocol. No effect on WHOOP 4.0."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En una conexión 5/MG, NOOP enviará una solicitud de transmisión en tiempo real (puffin) después del handshake y registrará lo que regrese. Si tienes una banda 5/MG, activarlo y compartir tu registro de banda ayuda a mapear el protocolo. No afecta a WHOOP 4.0."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bei einer 5/MG-Verbindung sendet NOOP nach dem Handshake eine Puffin-Echtzeitstream-Anfrage und protokolliert die Antwort. Wenn du einen 5/MG-Strap hast, hilft das Aktivieren und Teilen deines Strap-Protokolls, das Protokoll zu kartieren. Keine Auswirkung auf WHOOP 4.0."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On days you logged ‘%@’, %@ was %@ (avg %lld vs %lld, n=%lld vs %lld).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
