    "The monitor beats in real time when your WHOOP is nearby and worn.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The monitor beats in real time when your WHOOP is nearby and worn."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El monitor late en tiempo real cuando tu WHOOP está cerca y puesta."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Monitor schlägt in Echtzeit, wenn dein WHOOP in der Nähe und angelegt ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The thread of you over time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Verlauf über die Zeit."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The thread of you over time."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El hilo de ti a través del tiempo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These power your heart-rate zones, calorie estimates and recovery baselines. Keep them accurate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese steuern deine Herzfrequenzzonen, Kalorienschätzungen und Erholungs-Basislinien. Halte sie genau."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These power your heart-rate zones, calorie estimates and recovery baselines. Keep them accurate."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estos datos alimentan tus zonas de frecuencia cardiaca, las estimaciones de calorías y tus líneas base de recuperación. Mantenlos precisos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Denkt nach"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thinking"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pensando"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This builds from the strap as it syncs. Strain and sleep appear after you have worn it and slept a night. Recovery needs about a week of nights to learn your baseline, or import your WHOOP export to skip the wait.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies baut sich aus dem Strap auf, während er synchronisiert. Belastung und Schlaf erscheinen, nachdem du ihn getragen und eine Nacht geschlafen hast. Die Erholung braucht etwa eine Woche an Nächten, um deine Basislinie zu lernen, oder importiere deinen WHOOP-Export, um die Wartezeit zu überspringen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This builds from the strap as it syncs. Strain and sleep appear after you have worn it and slept a night. Recovery needs about a week of nights to learn your baseline, or import your WHOOP export to skip the wait."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto se construye desde la banda conforme sincroniza. El esfuerzo y el sueño aparecen después de usarla y dormir una noche. La recuperación necesita alrededor de una semana de noches para aprender tu línea base, o importa tu exportación de WHOOP para saltarte la espera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the only feature that leaves your Mac — it sends a summary of your metrics to %@ using your own key. Nothing is sent until you ask.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies ist die einzige Funktion, die deinen Mac verlässt — sie sendet eine Zusammenfassung deiner Metriken mit deinem eigenen Schlüssel an %@. Es wird nichts gesendet, bis du es anforderst."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the only feature that leaves your Mac — it sends a summary of your metrics to %@ using your own key. Nothing is sent until you ask."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta es la única función que sale de tu Mac — envía un resumen de tus métricas a %@ usando tu propia clave. No se envía nada hasta que tú preguntes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This reading can come from Apple Health. Connect it from Today to see it here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
