    "WHOOP straps don't appear in macOS System Settings → Bluetooth. They advertise on a custom profile that only apps like Cénit can find — so there's nothing to pair there, and you shouldn't try.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WHOOP-Straps erscheinen nicht in den macOS-Systemeinstellungen → Bluetooth. Sie senden über ein eigenes Profil, das nur Apps wie Cénit finden können — dort gibt es also nichts zu koppeln, und du solltest es nicht versuchen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WHOOP straps don't appear in macOS System Settings → Bluetooth. They advertise on a custom profile that only apps like Cénit can find — so there's nothing to pair there, and you shouldn't try."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las bandas WHOOP no aparecen en Configuración del Sistema → Bluetooth de macOS. Se anuncian con un perfil personalizado que solo apps como Cénit pueden encontrar — así que no hay nada que emparejar ahí, y no deberías intentarlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WHOOP straps don't appear in macOS System Settings → Bluetooth. They advertise on a custom profile that only apps like NOOP can find — so there's nothing to pair there, and you shouldn't try.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WHOOP straps don't appear in macOS System Settings → Bluetooth. They advertise on a custom profile that only apps like NOOP can find — so there's nothing to pair there, and you shouldn't try."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las bandas WHOOP no aparecen en Configuración del Sistema → Bluetooth de macOS. Se anuncian con un perfil personalizado que solo apps como NOOP pueden encontrar — así que no hay nada que emparejar ahí, y no deberías intentarlo."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WHOOP-Straps erscheinen nicht in den macOS-Systemeinstellungen → Bluetooth. Sie senden über ein eigenes Profil, das nur Apps wie NOOP finden können — dort gibt es also nichts zu koppeln, und du solltest es nicht versuchen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
