          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's the average of your heart rate variability over the last week. Higher usually goes hand in hand with better recovery.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's the average of your heart rate variability over the last week. Higher usually goes hand in hand with better recovery."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es el promedio de tu variabilidad cardiaca de la última semana. Más alta suele ir de la mano con mejor recuperación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where your HRV usually lands when you're well. Only worth noting when a day falls outside it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Where your HRV usually lands when you're well. Only worth noting when a day falls outside it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Donde suele caer tu HRV cuando estás bien. Solo vale la pena fijarse si un día se sale de aquí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How even it stays from one week to the next. Steadier usually means better rest; very uneven can be fatigue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How even it stays from one week to the next. Steadier usually means better rest; very uneven can be fatigue."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qué tan pareja está de una semana a otra. Más pareja suele ser mejor descanso; muy dispareja puede ser fatiga."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where your HRV is headed this month compared with last month.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Where your HRV is headed this month compared with last month."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hacia dónde va tu HRV este mes comparado con el anterior."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Other signals from your body while you sleep. When they all rise together, something is taxing you (illness, alcohol, hard effort).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Other signals from your body while you sleep. When they all rise together, something is taxing you (illness, alcohol, hard effort)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Otras señales de tu cuerpo mientras duermes. Si suben todas juntas, algo te está exigiendo (enfermedad, alcohol, mucho esfuerzo)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's your lowest heart rate while you sleep. Lower usually points to better fitness and rest.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
