    "Physical age measures only the cardiorespiratory side. This one also weighs sleep, regularity, HRV and steps — so the two can differ.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Physical age measures only the cardiorespiratory side. This one also weighs sleep, regularity, HRV and steps — so the two can differ."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La Edad física mide solo el lado cardiorrespiratorio. Esta también pesa sueño, regularidad, HRV y pasos — por eso pueden no coincidir."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Fitnessalter misst nur die kardiorespiratorische Seite. Dieses berücksichtigt auch Schlaf, Regelmäßigkeit, HRV und Schritte — daher können beide abweichen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A wellness comparison, not a biological age or a clinical diagnosis. HRV is estimated from nighttime PPG; the reference norm is conservative.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A wellness comparison, not a biological age or a clinical diagnosis. HRV is estimated from nighttime PPG; the reference norm is conservative."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una comparación de bienestar, no una edad biológica ni un diagnóstico clínico. La HRV se estima desde PPG nocturno; la norma de referencia es conservadora."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Vergleich des Wohlbefindens, kein biologisches Alter und keine klinische Diagnose. Die HRV wird aus nächtlichem PPG geschätzt; die Referenznorm ist konservativ."
          }
        }
      }
    },
