    "Regularity is the night-to-night variability of your mid-sleep point (the midpoint between falling asleep and waking) — a steadier schedule predicts health more strongly than how long you sleep. Stages are estimated from movement, heart rate and HRV, so they're approximate; deep sleep repairs the body, REM consolidates memory and emotion. \"Need\" is a 7–9 h population target, not a measurement of you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Regularity is the night-to-night variability of your mid-sleep point (the midpoint between falling asleep and waking) — a steadier schedule predicts health more strongly than how long you sleep. Stages are estimated from movement, heart rate and HRV, so they're approximate; deep sleep repairs the body, REM consolidates memory and emotion. \"Need\" is a 7–9 h population target, not a measurement of you."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La regularidad es la variabilidad noche a noche de tu punto medio de sueño (el punto medio entre dormirte y despertar) — un horario más parejo predice tu salud con más fuerza que cuánto duermes. Las etapas se estiman del movimiento, la frecuencia cardíaca y la HRV, así que son aproximadas; el sueño profundo repara el cuerpo, el REM consolida memoria y emociones. La «necesidad» es un objetivo poblacional de 7–9 h, no una medición tuya."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Regelmäßigkeit ist die nächtliche Schwankung deines Schlafmittelpunkts (der Mitte zwischen Einschlafen und Aufwachen) — ein gleichmäßigerer Rhythmus sagt die Gesundheit stärker voraus als die Schlafdauer. Phasen werden aus Bewegung, Herzfrequenz und HRV geschätzt, also ungefähr; Tiefschlaf repariert den Körper, REM festigt Gedächtnis und Emotionen. Der „Bedarf“ ist ein Bevölkerungsziel von 7–9 Std., keine Messung an dir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windred et al., Sleep 2024 (regularity); Miller et al., J Sports Sci 2020 (wrist staging vs PSG); Hirshkowitz et al., 2015 (sleep need).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Windred et al., Sleep 2024 (regularity); Miller et al., J Sports Sci 2020 (wrist staging vs PSG); Hirshkowitz et al., 2015 (sleep need)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Windred et al., Sleep 2024 (regularidad); Miller et al., J Sports Sci 2020 (etapas en muñeca vs PSG); Hirshkowitz et al., 2015 (necesidad de sueño)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Windred et al., Sleep 2024 (Regelmäßigkeit); Miller et al., J Sports Sci 2020 (Phasen am Handgelenk vs. PSG); Hirshkowitz et al., 2015 (Schlafbedarf)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
