    "No nights yet. Import your WHOOP export — or connect Apple Health — in Data Sources to see your sleep stages and trends. Or wear the strap to bed and open it again after the strap syncs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No nights yet. Import your WHOOP export — or connect Apple Health — in Data Sources to see your sleep stages and trends. Or wear the strap to bed and open it again after the strap syncs."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún no hay noches. Importa tu exportación de WHOOP — o conecta Apple Salud — en Fuentes de datos para ver tus etapas y tendencias de sueño. O usa la banda al dormir y ábrelo de nuevo cuando la banda se sincronice."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noch keine Nächte. Importiere deinen WHOOP-Export — oder verbinde Apple Health — in Datenquellen, um deine Schlafphasen und Trends zu sehen. Oder trage das Band zum Schlafen und öffne es erneut, sobald das Band synchronisiert hat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
